   ┌───▶│  Fire   │────────────────────────▶│Swapping │
   │    └────────┘                          └────┬────┘
   │         ▲                                     │ 0.2–0.3s
   │         │                                      ▼
   │    ┌────┴───┐    swapRequested(Fire)      ┌────────┐
   │    │ Water   │◀───────────────────────────│ Water   │
   │    └────────┘                              (settled)
   │                                            └────────┘
   │  (Earth and Wood states follow the same pattern;
   │   'Swapping' is a shared transient state for ANY
   └── element pair, parameterized by fromElement/toElement)
```

